Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Dario Griffo <dariogriffo@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/juanfont/headscale
Package: headscale
Version: headscale_VERSION-BUILD_VERSION+DIST
Architecture: SUPPORTED_ARCHITECTURES
Depends: adduser
Description: An open source, self-hosted implementation of the Tailscale control server
 Headscale is an open source, self-hosted implementation of the Tailscale
 control server. This package installs the headscale binary, a systemd
 service and a default configuration file.
